595
00:30:01,867 --> 00:30:04,067
I had Chinese last night.

596
00:30:04,136 --> 00:30:05,981
So I thought I'd
settle for a hot dog.

597
00:30:06,005 --> 00:30:07,648
Trying to hold on to my figure.

598
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:10,185
♪ Dee-dee-dee... ♪

599
00:30:10,209 --> 00:30:14,277
