621
00:31:03,095 --> 00:31:05,295
Well, it's not making
me feel better, all right?

622
00:31:05,698 --> 00:31:07,564
That's a shame.

623
00:31:07,632 --> 00:31:09,532
Makes me feel better.

624
00:31:11,103 --> 00:31:13,170
Dee-dee-dee-dee ♪

625
00:31:13,239 --> 00:31:14,771
♪ Dee-dee-dee ♪

