652
00:32:44,830 --> 00:32:46,096
I just knew it. See there?

653
00:32:46,164 --> 00:32:49,099
That's it. That's it.

654
00:33:03,115 --> 00:33:04,347
Hello.

655
00:33:04,416 --> 00:33:05,848
